{
  "_readme": "LinkedIn data for the dashboard's Objectives section. LinkedIn's API does not expose personal post analytics without an approved developer app, so this file is refreshed from LinkedIn's own export: Analytics -> Export (an .xlsx with Discovery / Engagement / Top Posts / Followers / Audience Demographics / Content Demographics tabs). To refresh: send the export (or screenshots of its tabs) to a Claude Code session and ask it to update this file -- it replaces 'export' and merges 'posts'. 'schedule' lists standing posting weekdays (Sun..Sat); every such day counts as a post day for the traffic correlation even without a logged entry. Percentages recorded as '<1%' are stored as 0.5.",
